{title: Tumhawar Keli Mi Marji Bahal}
{artist: Pinjara Usha Mangeshkar}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#]Tumhavar [G]keli mi [A]marji bahal
[A]naka sodun jau, [G#]rangamahal
[C#m]papnyanchi toran [G#]bandhun dolyavarti
[C#m]hi najar [G#]udhalite kaljatali pitri
[C#m]javali yaava, [A]malaa pusav, [G#]gupit maz khushal
[G#]gupit maza khushal
[C#m]hurhur mhanu ki [G#]odha mhanu hi goad
[C#m]ya basa manchaki, [G#]sutal gulabi kod
[C#m]virah jalita [A]mala raat [G#]hi pasari mayajal
[G#]pasari mayajal
[C#m]lade-lade adabina [G#]tumha vinavite bai
[C#m]piraticha ughadala [G#]pinjara tumachya payi
[C#m]ashich rahavi [A]raat sajana kadhi [G#]na vhavi sakaal
[G#]kadhi na vhavi sakaal
